            <p class="lead-text">Organizations have more data than ever, but reporting is slow, KPIs are unclear, forecasting is difficult, and processes remain manual.</p>
            <p class="lead-text">Decision-makers struggle to turn information into action. Insight without a decision is just noise. We bridge the gap between technical infrastructure and strategic execution.</p>
        </div>
